{
  "id": "steam_pipes___online_pressure_drop_calculator",
  "title": "Steam Pipes - Online Pressure Drop Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate the pressure drop in saturated steam distribution pipe lines using metric or imperial units. Based on the Unwin formula for steam flow in pipes.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Pressure Drop Calculation\n\nThe pressure drop in a saturated steam distribution pipe line can be calculated using the Unwin formula:\n\n**Metric Units:**\n$$dp = 0.6753 \\times 10^6 \\times q^2 \\times l \\times (1 + 91.4/d) / (\\rho \\times d^5)$$\n\n**Imperial Units:**\n$$dp = 0.0001306 \\times q^2 \\times l \\times (1 + 3.6/d) / (3600 \\times \\rho \\times d^5)$$\n\nNote: For pressure drops exceeding 10-15% of initial absolute pressure, use values corresponding to average pressure."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "unit_system",
          "label": "Unit System",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Metric (SI)",
              "value": "metric"
            },
            {
              "label": "Imperial (US)",
              "value": "imperial"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "metric"
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_rate",
          "label": "Steam Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/h",
          "defaultValue": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_length",
          "label": "Pipe Length",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter",
          "label": "Pipe Inside Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 102
        },
        {
          "id": "steam_density",
          "label": "Steam Density",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 5.15
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "pressure_drop",
          "label": "Pressure Drop",
          "formula": "(0.6753 * Math.pow(10, 6) * Math.pow(inputs.flow_rate, 2) * inputs.pipe_length * (1 + 91.4 / inputs.pipe_diameter)) / (inputs.steam_density * Math.pow(inputs.pipe_diameter, 5))",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_drop_kpa",
          "label": "Pressure Drop",
          "formula": "((0.6753 * Math.pow(10, 6) * Math.pow(inputs.flow_rate, 2) * inputs.pipe_length * (1 + 91.4 / inputs.pipe_diameter)) / (inputs.steam_density * Math.pow(inputs.pipe_diameter, 5))) / 1000",
          "unit": "kPa",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Metric Value",
        "Unit"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Steam Flow Rate",
          "4000",
          "kg/h"
        ],
        [
          "Pipe Length",
          "100",
          "m"
        ],
        [
          "Pipe Inside Diameter",
          "102",
          "mm"
        ],
        [
          "Steam Density",
          "5.15",
          "kg/m³"
        ],
        [
          "Pressure Drop (Calculated)",
          "36030",
          "Pa"
        ],
        [
          "Pressure Drop (Calculated)",
          "36",
          "kPa"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}